# Local biosignal fallback fixture (report1.5.html/report1.6.html use it only
# when R2 is unreachable, for local/offline testing). It contains real biosignal
# data (waveforms, an audio recording) with no auth in front of it if served as
# a static file — must never ship to production. If report1.5/1.6 need a local
# fallback in production too, that has to go through an authenticated API route
# instead of a public static file.
ecg_results.json

